WEBVTT

00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:33.774
Five times more value
and a happier workforce.

00:02:33.816 --> 00:02:36.569
So the question is,
how do these companies do it?

00:02:36.611 --> 00:02:41.115
How do they achieve these symbiotic
human-AI relationships?

00:02:41.157 --> 00:02:42.658
I have some answers.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.078
First of all, they don't think of AI
in the most extreme case

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.705
only to replace humans.

00:02:47.747 --> 00:02:51.042
Instead, they look deep
inside their organizations

00:02:51.042 --> 00:02:53.336
and at the various roles
their people play.

00:02:53.377 --> 00:02:54.503
And they ask:

00:02:54.545 --> 00:02:59.258
How can AI make our people
more fulfilled, more effective,

00:02:59.258 --> 00:03:00.843
more amplified?